\par\par \b \uc2 Japan MOF Tango: To Focus On  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Movements\b0\par\par\uc2 220 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 September 2009\par 10:12\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2009 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 TOKYO (Dow Jones)--The top bureaucrat at Japan's \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  said Monday that the Japanese government is watching \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  movements.\par \par \uc2 "We are paying close attention to \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  movements," Vice Finance Minister Yasutake Tango said at a regular press conference. Tango said he would not comment on specific market levels, however.\par \par \uc2 Tango's comments come after the yen marked a fresh 7-month high against the dollar earlier Monday. In morning trade in Tokyo, the dollar fell to Y90.18, its lowest level since Feb. 12.\par \par \uc2 At 0817 GMT the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was trading at Y90.64.\par \par \uc2 Yen strength hurts Japan's exporters, making their products more expensive overseas and eating into overseas earnings sent back to Japan. Some \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  traders have said that such concerns could prompt the Japanese government to step into \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets to put the brakes on the yen if it strengthens further and faster.\par \par \uc2 The strong yen sent Japan's benchmark Nikkei 225 Stock Average down 2.3% Monday to close at 10,202.06.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which controls \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy, has not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets since spring 2004.\par \par \uc2 -By Andrew Monahan, Dow Jones Newswires; 813-6895-7553; andrew.monahan@dowjones.com [ 14-09-09 0825GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020090914e59e000cd\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
